{
  "title": { "zh": "算一算" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "定义也是改写规则：<part-ref to=\"lemma:simp\"></part-ref>的规则里多了一组「定义」。<level-ref to=\"nl-plus\"></level-ref>里手算的，可以交给它。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": { "zh": "在证明助手里，计算就是改写。" },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "sp-compute",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "words": ["everyday", "terms"],
      "defs": ["plus"],
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "plus(s(zero), s(zero)) = s(s(zero))" },
        { "goal": "plus(s(s(zero)), s(zero)) = s(s(s(zero)))" },
        { "goal": "plus(zero, s(s(zero))) = s(s(zero))" }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "先让化简用两条定义把左边算出来；两边一样以后，用<part-ref to=\"part:rule\"></part-ref>接上<part-ref to=\"part:refl\"></part-ref>。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = math[use=[\"def.0\", \"def.1\"]]()",
        "c1r0 = refl()",
        "c0 = simp(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)",
        "out <- c1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
